.git
.env
data
docs
ops
*.md

# config/ is COPYed into the image so a forgotten mount is a stale table rather
# than a process that will not start. The *.md rule above would quietly drop
# persona.md out of it in P5, and the symptom would be a voice that ignores
# every edit — so it is excepted here, now, rather than found later.
!config/persona.md
